#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:7
msgid "In-Context Learning · Phenomenon reproduction"
msgstr "上下文学习 · 现象复现"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:10
msgid "In-Context Associative Recall"
msgstr "上下文关联回忆（In-Context Associative Recall）"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:13
msgid ""
"A small causal Transformer learns to retrieve the value paired with a "
"queried key from the current token sequence."
msgstr "一个小型因果 Transformer 学会从当前 token 序列中找回与查询键配对的值。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:22
msgid "QQ"
msgstr "清宇"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:27
msgid "Author"
msgstr "作者"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:35
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "范围"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:37
msgid "**Phenomenon reproduction**"
msgstr "**现象复现**"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Abstract"
msgstr "摘要"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:42
msgid ""
"This graph trains a token Transformer on synthetic key-value sequences "
"and exposes accuracy, attention maps, and attention-relation scores. It "
"is a controlled demonstration of in-context associative recall, not a "
"claim about general-purpose language-model reasoning."
msgstr ""
"本图在合成键值序列上训练 token Transformer，展示准确率、attention map 和 attention 关系分数。"
"它在受控条件下演示上下文关联回忆，并不主张通用语言模型具有相应的推理能力。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:48
msgid "**Template:** `in context associative recall`"
msgstr "**模板：** `in context associative recall`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:50
msgid "**Template ID:** `5d1a2ab4-825d-4251-8a5a-d7b83b42c1d7`"
msgstr "**模板 ID：** `5d1a2ab4-825d-4251-8a5a-d7b83b42c1d7`"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:52
msgid "Reproduction Goal"
msgstr "复现目标"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:54
msgid ""
"Each example has four key-value pairs followed by a query key; the target"
" is the paired value from the same context. The attention views make it "
"possible to inspect whether query positions attend to relevant key or "
"value positions as accuracy improves."
msgstr "每个样本包含四个键值对，随后给出一个查询键；目标是同一上下文中与其配对的值。随着准确率提高，可通过 attention 视图查看查询位置是否关注相关的键或值位置。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:59
msgid "Experiment Configuration"
msgstr "实验配置"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Template setting"
msgstr "模板设置"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Data"
msgstr "数据"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid ""
"Fixed synthetic recall sequences; vocabulary size 8 and four pairs per "
"context"
msgstr "固定的合成回忆序列；词表大小为 8，每个上下文含四个键值对"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Data size"
msgstr "数据规模"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "10,000 train and 2,000 test sequences, seed 0"
msgstr "10,000 个训练序列和 2,000 个测试序列，seed 为 0"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Model"
msgstr "模型"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid ""
"Causal Transformer: dimension 6, two heads, two layers, feed-forward "
"dimension 24"
msgstr "因果 Transformer：维度为 6，两个 attention head、两层，前馈维度为 24"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Objective and optimizer"
msgstr "目标函数与优化器"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Cross-entropy; Adam at learning rate 0.001"
msgstr "交叉熵；Adam，学习率为 0.001"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Training"
msgstr "训练"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "CPU, batch size 256; primary Trainer runs 4,000 updates and logs every 200"
msgstr "CPU，批量大小为 256；主 Trainer 运行 4,000 次更新，每 200 次更新记录一次"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid "Observables"
msgstr "observables"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:39
msgid ""
"Accuracy, attention maps, attention-relation scores, and metric "
"comparisons"
msgstr "准确率、attention map、attention 关系分数和指标比较"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:70
msgid "Run in Comfy Research"
msgstr "在 Comfy Research 中运行"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:72
msgid "Open **Templates** and load `in context associative recall`."
msgstr "打开 **模板** 并加载 `in context associative recall`。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:73
msgid "Run the primary Trainer and inspect training and accuracy views."
msgstr "运行主 Trainer，查看训练过程和准确率视图。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:74
msgid ""
"Run the separate attention-diagnostics Trainer, then inspect its "
"attention maps and relation scores."
msgstr "运行单独的 attention 诊断 Trainer，然后查看其 attention map 和关系分数。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:76
msgid ""
"Compare the two runs qualitatively: the diagnostic Trainer is an "
"independent training run, not a checkpoint restored from the primary "
"Trainer."
msgstr "定性比较两次运行：诊断 Trainer 是独立训练得到的结果，并非从主 Trainer 的 checkpoint 恢复。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:80
msgid ""
"Loaded in-context associative recall template showing the synthetic token"
" dataset, causal Transformer, accuracy Trainer, and attention-diagnostics"
" Trainer."
msgstr "已载入上下文关联回忆模板，其中包含合成 token 数据集、因果 Transformer、准确率 Trainer 和 attention 诊断 Trainer。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:85
msgid "Results and Interpretation"
msgstr "结果与解释"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:87
msgid ""
"The expected outcome is rising held-out recall accuracy accompanied by "
"attention patterns that connect a query to relevant context items. These "
"are diagnostic probes for this synthetic task; they do not alone prove a "
"unique causal role for a particular attention head."
msgstr "预期结果是留出集回忆准确率上升，并出现将查询与相关上下文项相连的 attention 模式。这些只是该合成任务的诊断探针，不能单凭它们证明某个特定 attention head 具有唯一的因果作用。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:92
msgid ""
"Metric comparison visualization showing held-out accuracy alongside "
"attention-relation scores during in-context associative recall training."
msgstr "指标比较可视化：展示上下文关联回忆训练期间的留出集准确率和 attention 关系分数。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:97
msgid ""
"Attention relation score visualization for the previous token relation, "
"with scores for the two selected layer-head pairs."
msgstr "前一个 token 关系的 attention 关系分数可视化，展示所选两组 layer-head 的分数。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:102
msgid ""
"Attention relation score visualization for the induction relation, with "
"scores for the two selected layer-head pairs."
msgstr "归纳关系的 attention 关系分数可视化，展示所选两组 layer-head 的分数。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:107
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "局限性"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:109
msgid "Vocabulary, context length, and model size are intentionally tiny."
msgstr "词表、上下文长度和模型规模都刻意设得很小。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:110
msgid "Synthetic recall does not cover natural-language understanding."
msgstr "合成回忆任务并不涵盖自然语言理解。"

#: ../../en/examples/reproductions/in-context-associative-recall.md:111
msgid "Attention scores are useful probes, not a complete causal explanation."
msgstr "attention 分数是有用的探针，但不能构成完整的因果解释。"
